                                "sense_id": "eaec942b-7851-32ed-858b-facfea8f91fd",
                                "text": "“I'm fair peched,” Grandad said, as he said every Sunday.\n“That's 'cos you're old, Granda.” Wee Jean cooried into the old man's side, hiding from the North Sea wind."
